      "questionText": "<p><strong>Write suitable words to complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/set_2_-_city_life_a828992c.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p>Grace: How do you usually get to work?</p>\n<p>Jake: I usually take <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-905071-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-905071-0' type='text' size='17' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-905071-0' /></span></strong> because it&#8217;s fast and goes through tunnels below ground, so I don&#8217;t have to worry about traffic.</p>\n<p>Grace: Lucky you! I drive by car because I&#8217;m not close to any station. And I often get stuck in traffic, especially on the streets with a lot of <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-905071-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-905071-1' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-905071-1' /></span></strong>.</p>\n<p>Jake: Why don't you try another public transport?</p>\n<p>Grace: I&#8217;ve tried taking the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-905071-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-905071-2' type='text' size='6' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-905071-2' /></span></strong> before, but it takes too long since I have to change lines several times.</p>\n<p>Jake: Well, I heard there will be a new <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-905071-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-905071-3' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-905071-3' /></span></strong> line that is close to your house. It builds above the streets so it might be faster. You should try it!</p>\n<p>Grace: Thanks! I&#8217;ll definitely try it once it&#8217;s available.</p>",
