      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Read the following passage and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">City life can be exciting but also challenging. One of the biggest problems is <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='0' name='fbo-905076-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-905076-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-905076-0'></option><option value=\"adventure\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-0-adventure'>adventure</option><option value=\"congestion\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-0-congestion'>congestion</option><option value=\"pollution\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-0-pollution'>pollution</option><option value=\"entertainment\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-0-entertainment'>entertainment</option></select></span></strong>. The streets are very crowded with many vehicles, so it is hard for people to get around. Although <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='1' name='fbo-905076-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-905076-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-905076-1'></option><option value=\"global warming\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-1-global warming'>global warming</option><option value=\"community service\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-1-community service'>community service</option><option value=\"public transport\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-1-public transport'>public transport</option><option value=\"social media\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-1-social media'>social media</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;is a convenient option, there are still delays in the rush hour. I often rely on the<strong> </strong>bus line&nbsp;near my home, but sometimes it is late, especially in the morning. Another issue in the city is <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='2' name='fbo-905076-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-905076-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-905076-2'></option><option value=\"hygiene\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-2-hygiene'>hygiene</option><option value=\"fragrance\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-2-fragrance'>fragrance</option><option value=\"cost\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-2-cost'>cost</option><option value=\"population\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-2-population'>population</option></select></span></strong>. The water and air are polluted. Public places can sometimes be dirty. Some areas even look <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='3' name='fbo-905076-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-905076-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-905076-3'></option><option value=\"cozy\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-3-cozy'>cozy</option><option value=\"attractive\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-3-attractive'>attractive</option><option value=\"ugly\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-3-ugly'>ugly</option><option value=\"scary\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-3-scary'>scary</option></select></span></strong>, with old buildings and a lack of green space. Living in the city can also be <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.5</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='4' name='fbo-905076-4' data-testid='fillblank-select-905076-4'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-905076-4'></option><option value=\"habitable\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-4-habitable'>habitable</option><option value=\"expensive\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-4-expensive'>expensive</option><option value=\"affordable\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-4-affordable'>affordable</option><option value=\"economical\" data-testid='fillblank-option-905076-4-economical'>economical</option></select></span></strong>, with high prices for housing and everyday goods. However, living in the city also means having easy access to many shops, restaurants, and services, which can make life more convenient. Despite the challenges, city life offers many opportunities and excitement for those who enjoy it.</p>",
